14
00:01:08,340 --> 00:01:10,880
Naparaliti ko kat marigatan unay.

15
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:12,940
Umay ko pa imbaggan.

16
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:16,740
Kinunan ni Jesus insungbat ti kapitan.

17
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:20,240
Saan amasapol na umay ka, Apo?

18
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:24,460
Jak may kari na umawatkin ka itibalay ko?

19
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:28,960
Ag sa ukalaeng kat uminbag ti adipon ko.

20
00:01:29,880 --> 00:01:29,960
Taon.

21
